full-query: "You have created two AWS CloudFormation stacks in the AWS region us-east-1 Stack A has exported the resource output for a security group. Stack B uses the Fn::ImportValue intrinsic function to import the exported value in its template. Both stacks are in the CREATE_COMPLETE status. Now you would need to perform some actions on these stacks. Which of the following actions can you perform successfully?"
